(6815377, 1025234, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great job of using a very patriotic foreground element to throw attention to the FW.  A different crop may have eliminated some distractions, but it''s very good the way it is.  9</td>', 'Great job of using a very patriotic foreground element to throw attention to the FW.  A different crop may have eliminated some distractions, but it''s very good the way it is.  9', '2012-07-11 10:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
