(6815690, 1024555, 114225, '<td valign="top">Did you use a heavy handed recovery? Seems like the ares that should be naturally blown out have an unnatural grey-ness to them.<br/> <br/>I do like the overall presentation.</td>', 'Did you use a heavy handed recovery? Seems like the ares that should be naturally blown out have an unnatural grey-ness to them. I do like the overall presentation.', '2012-07-11 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
