(6815838, 1024808, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giving this my highest vote.<br/>Without a doubt the best in the challenge. Two free spirits enjoying the ocean (I assumed, but could be a lake). I''d hang this on my wall.</td>', 'Giving this my highest vote.Without a doubt the best in the challenge. Two free spirits enjoying the ocean (I assumed, but could be a lake). I''d hang this on my wall.', '2012-07-11 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6815839, 1025181, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giving this my second highest vote. <br/>There''s another entry I think is vastly superior to this one. That being said, this stand alone here. If the street was a little longer to further give the feeling of isolation it would have made this slightly better.</td>', 'Giving this my second highest vote. There''s another entry I think is vastly superior to this one. That being said, this stand alone here. If the street was a little longer to further give the feeling of isolation it would have made this slightly better.', '2012-07-11 21:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6815840, 1024464, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.<br/>The look on her face is serene. Like there''s not a how or a why in the world. Just floating along where ever the current may take her.</td>', 'Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.The look on her face is serene. Like there''s not a how or a why in the world. Just floating along where ever the current may take her.', '2012-07-11 21:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6815842, 1025221, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.<br/>I would have titled it "Answers to No One", but that''s a minor quibble. This was the idea I had when the challenge was first announced, but I don''t plan on entering anymore challenges, and couldn''t find the appropriate nomad, for lack of a better term, to photograph. There''s a sense he just doesn''t a crap about the world or someone three feet away taking his picture.</td>', 'Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.I would have titled it "Answers to No One", but that''s a minor quibble. This was the idea I had when the challenge was first announced, but I don''t plan on entering anymore challenges, and couldn''t find the appropriate nomad, for lack of a better term, to photograph. There''s a sense he just doesn''t a crap about the world or someone three feet away taking his picture.', '2012-07-11 21:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6815843, 1025215, 144365, '<td valign="top">Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.<br/>Hard to give the reasons I like this over some of the others. Maybe it''s just different from all the flag waving and firework entries. This is the only one I''m having trouble explaining with my comments.</td>', 'Giving this my third highest vote along with two others.Hard to give the reasons I like this over some of the others. Maybe it''s just different from all the flag waving and firework entries. This is the only one I''m having trouble explaining with my comments.', '2012-07-11 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
