(6819040, 1024521, 120171, '<td valign="top">You have your hands full there. An image to embarrass her when she is older.<br/> <br/>A classic childhood moment captured ans so fitting to this challenge. 9.</td>', 'You have your hands full there. An image to embarrass her when she is older. A classic childhood moment captured ans so fitting to this challenge. 9.', '2012-07-16 17:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819136, 1024645, 137320, '<td valign="top">The negatives are the framing (cutting off the top of a very important part of the picture, while including a bit of unnecessary stuff on the side) and the clipping highlights/ burning white, possessed feel of the building. On the positive side, regarding the sky, I like the way you were able to capture the feel of night, but still make out color and clouds, and I love the light from the fireworks on the top of the building. To me that is the best part and without it may have scored this a 4. With it however, I gave this a 6, and a super long comment! :)</td>', 'The negatives are the framing (cutting off the top of a very important part of the picture, while including a bit of unnecessary stuff on the side) and the clipping highlights/ burning white, possessed feel of the building. On the positive side, regarding the sky, I like the way you were able to capture the feel of night, but still make out color and clouds, and I love the light from the fireworks on the top of the building. To me that is the best part and without it may have scored this a 4. With it however, I gave this a 6, and a super long comment! :)', '2012-07-16 20:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819139, 1024942, 137320, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little out of focus... and am not usually a big fan of selective coloring, although it doesn''t bother me too much in this. I do think it would have been stronger with only the main subject being colored if you''re going to go that route, otherwise all the extra yellow spots are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Seems to be a little out of focus... and am not usually a big fan of selective coloring, although it doesn''t bother me too much in this. I do think it would have been stronger with only the main subject being colored if you''re going to go that route, otherwise all the extra yellow spots are a bit distracting.', '2012-07-16 20:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819144, 1025213, 137320, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far. Absolutely love how you captured the smoke cloud, especially by his hat. I may have desaturated his face a bit as it seems a bit red and it would bring more impact to the other colors. But a good concept, and well executed.</td>', 'My favorite so far. Absolutely love how you captured the smoke cloud, especially by his hat. I may have desaturated his face a bit as it seems a bit red and it would bring more impact to the other colors. But a good concept, and well executed.', '2012-07-16 20:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819145, 1024451, 137320, '<td valign="top">A bit more blurry than I would like. Also not a big fan of the color choices in post. A wider shot, or having the subject look at the camera I think are a couple ways to have more of an impact.</td>', 'A bit more blurry than I would like. Also not a big fan of the color choices in post. A wider shot, or having the subject look at the camera I think are a couple ways to have more of an impact.', '2012-07-16 20:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819149, 1024397, 137320, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the processing in this. The white vignette, the highlights in her hair clipping, the extra striped hoola-hoop at the bottom is a bit distracting, as is the thing in the top left corner and the pair of legs just above her head. I think cropping those things out would have made this a much stronger and more focused image. Cute moment captured however, keep at it!</td>', 'Not a big fan of the processing in this. The white vignette, the highlights in her hair clipping, the extra striped hoola-hoop at the bottom is a bit distracting, as is the thing in the top left corner and the pair of legs just above her head. I think cropping those things out would have made this a much stronger and more focused image. Cute moment captured however, keep at it!', '2012-07-16 20:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819158, 1024988, 137320, '<td valign="top">Your concept is strong, as is the perspective, the sky, and the focus... but my favorite thing is the lighting on the building. The slow fade works really well and is very dramatic. The only thing that I think is wrong with this image is the horizon line. Looks like it could use a few degrees tilt clockwise. And I think it would have been really cool to find a way to accentuate the sun flare. I think the people that notice the sun shining on the flag will score this a few points higher than the people who don''t. I''m giving it an 8. Very well done.</td>', 'Your concept is strong, as is the perspective, the sky, and the focus... but my favorite thing is the lighting on the building. The slow fade works really well and is very dramatic. The only thing that I think is wrong with this image is the horizon line. Looks like it could use a few degrees tilt clockwise. And I think it would have been really cool to find a way to accentuate the sun flare. I think the people that notice the sun shining on the flag will score this a few points higher than the people who don''t. I''m giving it an 8. Very well done.', '2012-07-16 21:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819159, 1025215, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is adorable. The clean lines with the single non subject object works very well.  The processing however I think could have been a bit better. A little bit more on the bottom end of the histogram would have really helped, and the colors could use a little work... but compared to most of the other entries I''ve seen so far, this is fine art! lol Good job overall, you got a 7 from me :)</td>', 'This is adorable. The clean lines with the single non subject object works very well.  The processing however I think could have been a bit better. A little bit more on the bottom end of the histogram would have really helped, and the colors could use a little work... but compared to most of the other entries I''ve seen so far, this is fine art! lol Good job overall, you got a 7 from me :)', '2012-07-16 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819161, 1024627, 137320, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a photo called "windows" I''ve recently seen ;) I liked that one a tad better though as in this one I think the tones of the clouds/sky in the middle look a bit unnatural. Still a cool building though.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a photo called "windows" I''ve recently seen ;) I liked that one a tad better though as in this one I think the tones of the clouds/sky in the middle look a bit unnatural. Still a cool building though.', '2012-07-16 21:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819162, 1024870, 137320, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focus is a tad off. If it was either razor sharp or MORE out of focus I think it would do a little better. Still a cool shot!</td>', 'Looks like the focus is a tad off. If it was either razor sharp or MORE out of focus I think it would do a little better. Still a cool shot!', '2012-07-16 21:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819166, 1025181, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is almost exactly the shot I wanted to do for this challenge, but didn''t get around to taking it. So clearly I like the concept. The lighting and processing also are on a different level than your competition. Based on the entries I''ve seen so far, it would be SHOCKING if this did not ribbon! Very well done. For the technical details as well as the emotion...I''m giving this a perfect 10</td>', 'This is almost exactly the shot I wanted to do for this challenge, but didn''t get around to taking it. So clearly I like the concept. The lighting and processing also are on a different level than your competition. Based on the entries I''ve seen so far, it would be SHOCKING if this did not ribbon! Very well done. For the technical details as well as the emotion...I''m giving this a perfect 10', '2012-07-16 21:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819168, 1024887, 137320, '<td valign="top">The highlights and shadows on her face are a bit out of control. Also be careful with your saturation in the summer where people are already a little red.</td>', 'The highlights and shadows on her face are a bit out of control. Also be careful with your saturation in the summer where people are already a little red.', '2012-07-16 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
