(6819612, 1025234, 149507, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the composition -- the interesting parts are bunched together and overlapping in the middle of the frame and there''s lots of uninteresting bits on the left. Maybe a slow-synch flash could have frozen the flag.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the composition -- the interesting parts are bunched together and overlapping in the middle of the frame and there''s lots of uninteresting bits on the left. Maybe a slow-synch flash could have frozen the flag.', '2012-07-17 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
