(6819820, 1025244, 69684, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the cake (probably taste good also). Looks like there are some other nice things in the background too:) But, although the colors fits in the challenge, they doesn''t make the whole look very appetizing (for the neutral viewer).</td>', 'Nice capture of the cake (probably taste good also). Looks like there are some other nice things in the background too:) But, although the colors fits in the challenge, they doesn''t make the whole look very appetizing (for the neutral viewer).', '2012-07-17 17:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
