(6820623, 1025181, 65319, '<td valign="top">Old age becomes a lesson like no other education. The joy of independence far outweighs the work involved to maintain it (for those individuals fortunate enough to have it!)  Alas, neglect of the elderly runs rampant in a world that passes by and becomes metered by the swift clicks of technology.  When life can no longer be measured and trafficked by streams of bits...What happens then?  Thank you for this image and reminder, John. <br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon...although disguised in red, carries all the spirit of true blue...;-)</td>', 'Old age becomes a lesson like no other education. The joy of independence far outweighs the work involved to maintain it (for those individuals fortunate enough to have it!)  Alas, neglect of the elderly runs rampant in a world that passes by and becomes metered by the swift clicks of technology.  When life can no longer be measured and trafficked by streams of bits...What happens then?  Thank you for this image and reminder, John.  Congrats on your ribbon...although disguised in red, carries all the spirit of true blue...;-)', '2012-07-18 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
