(6821327, 1024627, 99263, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> How in the world anybody knew this was a crop of another entry instead of just another shot, I have no idea.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry about your impending DQ.    I guess the site records the file name and that tipped them off.<br/> <br/>Such a bummer... *sigh* </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Aaagh no problem really. I made a mistake, it''s ok if they DQ it. Didn''t do well anyway so I would prefer if they just scrapped it altogether actually. Funny thing is I have about 6 other shots taken from exactly the same location that I could have used but since I had already edited this one it was easier for me to just make another crop out of it. Also I didn''t realize I was doing something that was not allowed. Too bad, no worries.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: How in the world anybody knew this was a crop of another entry instead of just another shot, I have no idea. I''m sorry about your impending DQ.    I guess the site records the file name and that tipped them off. Such a bummer... *sigh*   Aaagh no problem really. I made a mistake, it''s ok if they DQ it. Didn''t do well anyway so I would prefer if they just scrapped it altogether actually. Funny thing is I have about 6 other shots taken from exactly the same location that I could have used but since I had already edited this one it was easier for me to just make another crop out of it. Also I didn''t realize I was doing something that was not allowed. Too bad, no worries.', '2012-07-19 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
